    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĭmōlus</span></b> , i,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κίμωλος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an island of the
				Cyclades</i>, <i>distinguished for its chalky
			soil</i>, now <i>Kimolo</i> or <i>Argentiera</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12, 23, § 70</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Ov. M.
				7, 463</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĭmō-lĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>from Cimolus</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">creta (freq. used in medicine),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					2, 33</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 17, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Scrib.
				Comp. 245</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Veg. 2, 29</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">3, 4</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin.
				35, 17, 57, § 195 sq.</span></i></div>
